; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Stack.c	  1220   \DESCRIPTION    Os_Hal_StackEndGet is called with LowAddress and HighAddress of a Stack object. The stack object is
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Stack.c	  1221                   passed as argument to the caller function. Precondition ensures that the pointer is valid.
